It would be nice to keep track of FACLs of the files in /etc.  I believe this is rather easy to do, and have added scripts to `init.d` and `pre-commit.d` that restore and store ACLs, respectively.  Please consider pulling the changes from https://codeberg.org/tdussa/etckeeper (only the latest commit is relevant: https://codeberg.org/tdussa/etckeeper/commit/220cac62d7830cf15f923bfc466642b1ff8326f4).
